{"type":"message","id":"726895d1","parentId":"632a7cb5","timestamp":"2026-03-10T06:00:07.113Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_NdGhrKYi5EPUgKsbTH5fL3Rb|fc_0043b912863d3fac0169afb369049881919e98f833ccbc4ad1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 2026-03-10\n\n- 00:11 KST heartbeat: `workspace-heartbeat` is healthy, but `github-repo-daily-briefing` remains in cron error state (`lastStatus=error`, `consecutiveErrors=2`).\n- 00:44 KST heartbeat: `github-repo-daily-briefing` is still in cron error state; no new heartbeat-related regressions observed.\n- 09:13 KST heartbeat: `github-repo-daily-briefing` recovered to healthy (`lastStatus=ok`, `consecutiveErrors=0`); `SESSION-STATE.md` follow-up is now stale.\n- 10:18 KST heartbeat: all cron jobs remain healthy; stale local follow-up in `SESSION-STATE.md` was cleared to match current operational state.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773122407111}}
