{"type":"message","id":"09dbdaf6","parentId":"4523eb4f","timestamp":"2026-03-10T08:04:01.982Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_Rn8mDnUpQ3HQQeLpVXy1HTh6|fc_0043b912863d3fac0169afd07228a08191a4910a10689da7d7","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 2026-03-10\n\n- 00:11 KST heartbeat: `workspace-heartbeat` is healthy, but `github-repo-daily-briefing` remains in cron error state (`lastStatus=error`, `consecutiveErrors=2`).\n- 00:44 KST heartbeat: `github-repo-daily-briefing` is still in cron error state; no new heartbeat-related regressions observed.\n- 09:13 KST heartbeat: `github-repo-daily-briefing` recovered to healthy (`lastStatus=ok`, `consecutiveErrors=0`); `SESSION-STATE.md` follow-up is now stale.\n- 10:18 KST heartbeat: all cron jobs remain healthy; stale local follow-up in `SESSION-STATE.md` was cleared to match current operational state.\n- 15:21 KST heartbeat: `workspace-heartbeat` entered cron error state (`lastStatus=error`, `consecutiveErrors=1`) due to `cron: job execution timed out`.\n- 16:25 KST heartbeat: `workspace-heartbeat` remains in cron error state (`lastStatus=error`, `consecutiveErrors=1`); no new cron regressions detected beyond the active timeout condition.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773129841981}}
